<response><item key="0"><transcript-id>56</transcript-id><title>For press: Royal visit 1959</title><prime-minister>Menzies, Robert</prime-minister><period-of-service>19491219 - 19660126</period-of-service><field_date>16/03/1959</field_date><release-type>Media Release</release-type><document>https://pmtranscripts.pmc.gov.au/sites/default/files/original/00000056.pdf</document><subjects></subjects><content><![CDATA[<p style="text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:13.0pt;">FOR PRESS</span></p>
<p style="text-autospace:none;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:13.0pt;">ROYAL VISIT&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt;">1959.</span></p>
<p style="text-autospace:none;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:13.0pt;">Commonwealth and State authorities connected with the organisation of the visit to Australia of Her Royal Highness Princess Alexandra of Kent met in Canberra to-day.</span></p>
<p style="text-autospace:none;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:13.0pt;">They discussed co-ordination of the programme to be submitted to Her Royal Highness in London early next month, after her return from her visit to Latin America.</span></p>
<p style="text-autospace:none;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:13.0pt;">With the compliments of Robert Kennedy,</span></p>
<p style="text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:13.0pt;">Public Relations Director, Royal Visit&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt;">1959.</span></p>
<p style="text-autospace:none;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:13.0pt;">CANBERRA.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:13.0pt;">16th March,&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt;">1959.</span></p>
]]></content></item></response>
